{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid50", "sentence_id": "s001", "text": "你好，今天的会议改到下午3点半开始。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.255, "n_samples": 78117, "proc_s": 1.1198, "rtf": 0.344, "samples_sha256": "7c21053477b58fa123fb96f8c1d2a87b7e19966468bccb97430f875de84663f6"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid50", "sentence_id": "s002", "text": "我刚买了一部新的iPhone，用起来很顺手。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.633, "n_samples": 87197, "proc_s": 1.382, "rtf": 0.3804, "samples_sha256": "355c3e7ac73391a6597aef5ed658a1ed111c499b94e3cb3b61b03536def955cf"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid50", "sentence_id": "s003", "text": "这件衣服打折以后只要128元。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.75, "n_samples": 65989, "proc_s": 0.8141, "rtf": 0.2961, "samples_sha256": "342090433f3f114667f6ef03ccf2141408f1edd5f1580eab2b88e6ae81ea129d"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid50", "sentence_id": "s004", "text": "我们约在2026年10月20日见面吧。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.766, "n_samples": 66381, "proc_s": 0.8237, "rtf": 0.2978, "samples_sha256": "6a49f0852a85d89c414f3151ec670a2195b0eb1a2debebb70686851c39d5812c"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid50", "sentence_id": "s005", "text": "请把报告在周五之前发给我。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.276, "n_samples": 54632, "proc_s": 0.7144, "rtf": 0.3138, "samples_sha256": "954a11cb465d2f143cb7dc615d5e747765e3797654cbf606ea7d2d630071bcb2"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid50", "sentence_id": "s006", "text": "现在的AI工具越来越好用了。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.601, "n_samples": 62433, "proc_s": 0.9629, "rtf": 0.3702, "samples_sha256": "5e8bc02fd325c7752b9fa7db228dac96f4bd9a2aa493af2c5fc7aa273e082dc5"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid50", "sentence_id": "s007", "text": "你的航班几点起飞？我记得是早上8点20分。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.839, "n_samples": 92138, "proc_s": 1.3634, "rtf": 0.3551, "samples_sha256": "84e923b471b99e373cce9b7509fce0596ea47939f6da3f217391b987feeb42bf"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid50", "sentence_id": "s008", "text": "这个月的电费一共是356块钱。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.848, "n_samples": 68359, "proc_s": 0.9234, "rtf": 0.3242, "samples_sha256": "8795795d51215c1e87ae77d7b99f9116c5b09e169de3a3b726b5018f961dde1a"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid50", "sentence_id": "s009", "text": "我住在3楼，电梯就在门口右边。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.997, "n_samples": 71933, "proc_s": 1.0934, "rtf": 0.3648, "samples_sha256": "6b679e8ae5c38257af288898f433b06251f2b73efcc759d27d488f0d5df88a72"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid50", "sentence_id": "s010", "text": "他每天跑步5公里，已经坚持了两年。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.147, "n_samples": 75532, "proc_s": 1.1348, "rtf": 0.3606, "samples_sha256": "6c073831d7902319aff2b5cbc4c6c2f06f63bea5092dac3e1c814928a9b45524"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid50", "sentence_id": "s011", "text": "下周一我们要去上海出差。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.125, "n_samples": 51009, "proc_s": 0.6749, "rtf": 0.3175, "samples_sha256": "42eb8915423ff85e0beb2a7e8386bd5b9952266f22dd5c6f072bfc104ee5652a"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid50", "sentence_id": "s012", "text": "你能帮我订一张明天去北京的高铁票吗？", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.054, "n_samples": 73293, "proc_s": 0.8811, "rtf": 0.2885, "samples_sha256": "1f6e21d859a9f7d303a85e40776154e7e3a60074c2ad65c0cbd1f3451df3f197"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid50", "sentence_id": "s013", "text": "这家餐厅的评分是4.8分，值得一试。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.381, "n_samples": 81136, "proc_s": 1.2717, "rtf": 0.3762, "samples_sha256": "bf21467cde771b5feb060a4da63d7361a9d39d92627e52a2edc816d27f481019"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid50", "sentence_id": "s014", "text": "我的手机号是13812345678，有事打给我。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 4.242, "n_samples": 101810, "proc_s": 1.3769, "rtf": 0.3246, "samples_sha256": "0a9971f80e5e4e838f0ef35d9e6e9dae3a3983fc75bfb1015208440574421be2"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid50", "sentence_id": "s015", "text": "今年公司的销售额增长了15%。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.774, "n_samples": 66579, "proc_s": 0.9418, "rtf": 0.3395, "samples_sha256": "42a3921eac97984d951eedd150a201a62cf36f74ac775568b659016ed44f51ea"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid50", "sentence_id": "s016", "text": "孩子们放学以后在公园里踢足球。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.712, "n_samples": 65084, "proc_s": 0.7914, "rtf": 0.2918, "samples_sha256": "1fd8d0cce90d8e397e2ed7aa95aff5fbb6c09cd826330800dfc8e4e8aa4e7923"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid50", "sentence_id": "s017", "text": "我用微信给你转了2000块，记得查收。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.133, "n_samples": 75191, "proc_s": 1.161, "rtf": 0.3706, "samples_sha256": "1f8909487e3779ee691a461bf430d00481076792f5b64170cb934baa3ca01836"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid50", "sentence_id": "s018", "text": "天气预报说明天最高气温32度。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.762, "n_samples": 66278, "proc_s": 0.8922, "rtf": 0.3231, "samples_sha256": "ac68249a81e50f429019296f3bfa62194df369f213f557fb4ad474165e8e194d"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid50", "sentence_id": "s019", "text": "请问洗手间在哪里？", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 1.735, "n_samples": 41635, "proc_s": 0.5904, "rtf": 0.3403, "samples_sha256": "8ac4ba5f087558f8d8347eadead4b344ff88f9ab437167eee0c3e60bce85d33a"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid50", "sentence_id": "s020", "text": "我们的Zoom会议链接已经发到群里了。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.101, "n_samples": 74427, "proc_s": 1.1474, "rtf": 0.37, "samples_sha256": "bfe92ae04b92b47554bd1d36e08360d50b68b7d8103823c870e301ac138b0eb3"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid50", "sentence_id": "s021", "text": "这本书我看了一半，故事特别精彩。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.868, "n_samples": 68834, "proc_s": 1.0761, "rtf": 0.3752, "samples_sha256": "2cc09b48ab77685d06b631412818060d542269c6628114d4b0dc6f07bad39c63"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_0-en-zh-sid50", "sentence_id": "s022", "text": "他的生日是5月4日，我们准备给他一个惊喜。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.434, "n_samples": 82409, "proc_s": 1.1905, "rtf": 0.3467, "samples_sha256": "96c949d7faecbdbe5ba491794fda27bfc107d49eefcb0c98748faa40cc040dc2"}
